OL,3,ASouth Carolina elects Democratic
OL,4,Asenator for first time in almost three
OL,5,Adecades
OL,6,
OL,7,FRepublican South Carolina Senate
OL,8,Fcandidate Darline Graham is projected
OL,9,Fto have lost her race, handing
OL,10,FDemocrats their first victory in the
OL,11,Fstate for 28 years.
OL,13,FDemocrat Annie Andrews, a former
OL,14,Fpaediatrician, was on course to pull
OL,15,Foff a stunning upset in Tuesday's
OL,16,Fmidterm elections, according to the
OL,17,FBBC's US partner CBS.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
